module jev_capability_discovery_observation

input source_version
input contract_version
input query

status BOUND query matches read-only language capabilities
status DEFERRED query reaches an execution or authorization boundary
status UNKNOWN query, identity, or catalog evidence is unresolved

field matches
field suggestions
field first_mismatch
field missing_stage
field target_stage
field reason
field discovery_digest

constraint observation_only
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command
